{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794522640080,"sessionID":"ses_e2e209cc0ffeDJEbNMZEWmRu22","part":{"partID":"prt_1d1e26219001AwJ2rCIqaVlCJt","sessionID":"ses_e2e209cc0ffeDJEbNMZEWmRu22","messageID":"msg_1d1e25308001xQOhetaAeTsL6K","type":"tool","id":"call_be8284df3aec4569a8bc9bf2","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"**Audit this folder**\n\n```text\nUser request: Check .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy for sk-code and README coverage.\nSkill routing: sk-code plus sk-doc.\nExpected output: Findings recorded in the 026 audit report.\n```\n\n**Score captured runs**\n\n```bash\nnode .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs \\\n  --summary scratch/runs-pre.jsonl scratch/runs-post.jsonl --json\n```\n\nExit 2 means no score was produced. A missing or malformed log prints `run_log_missing` or `run_log_malformed`, and a session the reader cannot open prints its own code, such as `capability_gated`.\n\n**Inspect and run one behaviour turn**\n\n```bash\nnode .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs --print-argv claude\nnode .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs \\\n  --runtime claude --set chat --out scratch/runs-pre.jsonl --dry-run\n```\n\nExit 2 means the run was refused before or during its first prompt: bad flags, an unknown runtime or set, a holdout row, a dirty worktree outside the run log's folder, or a checkout that still has a git remote.","oldString":"**Audit this folder**\n\n```text\nUser request: Check .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy for sk-code and README coverage.\nSkill routing: sk-code plus sk-doc.\nExpected output: Findings recorded in the 026 audit report.\n```","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\n@@ -94,8 +94,27 @@\n Skill routing: sk-code plus sk-doc.\n Expected output: Findings recorded in the 026 audit report.\n ```\n \n+**Score captured runs**\n+\n+```bash\n+node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs \\\n+  --summary scratch/runs-pre.jsonl scratch/runs-post.jsonl --json\n+```\n+\n+Exit 2 means no score was produced. A missing or malformed log prints `run_log_missing` or `run_log_malformed`, and a session the reader cannot open prints its own code, such as `capability_gated`.\n+\n+**Inspect and run one behaviour turn**\n+\n+```bash\n+node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs --print-argv claude\n+node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs \\\n+  --runtime claude --set chat --out scratch/runs-pre.jsonl --dry-run\n+```\n+\n+Exit 2 means the run was refused before or during its first prompt: bad flags, an unknown runtime or set, a holdout row, a dirty worktree outside the run log's folder, or a checkout that still has a git remote.\n+\n ---\n \n ## 7. TROUBLESHOOTING\n \n","status":"modified","additions":19,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md (1 replaceme