{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794522653835,"sessionID":"ses_e2e209cc0ffeDJEbNMZEWmRu22","part":{"partID":"prt_1d1e2a2e40026gdPc6FLhN8epc","sessionID":"ses_e2e209cc0ffeDJEbNMZEWmRu22","messageID":"msg_1d1e2901d001jUACBCliOnkHPD","type":"tool","id":"call_8a621799161649fcb9e87345","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n \"score-command-transcripts|run-command-behaviour\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md"},"output":"73:| `score-command-transcripts.mjs` | Scores captured sessions through the shared session readers. `--summary <run-log> [<run-log>...]` scores every row one or more run logs list, per runtime and arm, and `--runtime <name> --locator '<json>'` scores the one session a locator names. `--row-id <id>` narrows either mode to one row and `--json` prints machine-readable output. Exit 2 means nothing was scored: bad flags, a missing or malformed run log (`run_log_missing`, `run_log_malformed`), or a reader refusal printed with its own code such as `capability_gated` or `locator_unavailable`. |\n74:| `run-command-behaviour.mjs` | Runs one live turn per row and records the locator, exit and changed paths. `--print-argv <runtime>` prints a runtime's argv, `--list <set>` prints a set's row ids, and a run takes `--runtime` with `--set` or repeated `--row-id`, `--out <run-log>`, optional `--arm`, `--fixture` and `--dry-run`. Exit 2 refuses instead of running: bad flags, an unknown runtime or set, a holdout or unknown row, a dirty worktree outside the run log's folder (`worktree_dirty`), or a checkout with a git remote (`remote_present`). |\n101:node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs \\\n110:node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs --print-argv claude\n111:node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs \\\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"73:| `score-command-transcripts.mjs` | Scores captured sessions through the shared session readers. `--summary <run-log> [<run-log>...]` scores every row one or more run logs list, per runtime and arm, and `--runtime <name> --locator '<json>'` scores the one session a locator names. `--row-id <id>` narrows either mode to one row and `--json` prints machine-readable output. Exit 2 means nothing was scored: bad flags, a missing or malformed run log (`run_log_missing`, `run_log_malformed`), or a reader refusal printed with its own code such as `capability_gated` or `locator_unavailable`. |\n74:| `run-command-behaviour.mjs` | Runs one live turn per row and records the locator, exit and changed paths. `--print-argv <runtime>` prints a runtime's argv, `--list <set>` prints a set's row ids, and a run takes `--runtime` with `--set` or repeated `--row-id`, `--out <run-log>`, optional `--arm`, `--fixture` and `--dry-run`. Exit 2 refuses instead of running: bad flags, an unknown runtime or set, a holdout or unknown row, a dirty worktree outside the run log's folder (`worktree_dirty`), or a checkout with a git remote (`remote_present`). |\n101:node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs \\\n110:node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs --print-argv claude\n111:node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs \\\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"rg -n \\\"score-command-transcripts|run-command-behaviour\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794522653413,"end":1794522653835}}}}
